1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,567
Did you know

2
00:00:00,567 --> 00:00:01,900
a scallop can have

3
00:00:01,900 --> 00:00:03,633
up to 200 eyes?

4
00:00:03,633 --> 00:00:04,500
Those blue dots

5
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:05,400
along the edge

6
00:00:05,400 --> 00:00:06,467
of its shell?

7
00:00:06,467 --> 00:00:07,933
Each one is an eye.

8
00:00:07,933 --> 00:00:09,500
Look inside one.

9
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:10,200
Light passes

10
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:11,000
through the eye

11
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:11,600
and hits

12
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:12,533
a curved mirror

13
00:00:12,533 --> 00:00:13,400
at the back.

14
00:00:13,400 --> 00:00:14,867
Tiny square crystals

15
00:00:14,867 --> 00:00:16,433
tile its surface.

16
00:00:16,433 --> 00:00:17,367
The mirror bounces

17
00:00:17,367 --> 00:00:18,167
light back

18
00:00:18,167 --> 00:00:19,433
onto a retina,

19
00:00:19,433 --> 00:00:20,067
like a little

20
00:00:20,067 --> 00:00:21,900
reflecting telescope.

21
00:00:21,900 --> 00:00:22,433
Can you spot

22
00:00:22,433 --> 00:00:23,833
the eyes now?
